---
// Props standing on the wooden table in front of the big TV. Rendered inside
// .tv so they track its size (cqi units) and position. Hidden on the pocket TV
// and on short landscape screens, where the table is only a thin strip.
---

<!-- snake plant, outside the TV's left edge -->
